📌 Note
This is a portfolio / practice project built to demonstrate full-stack AI engineering skills.

Uses SQLite for simplicity (production: PostgreSQL + Redis + Kafka)

Uses Gemini free tier for LLM

Runs on CPU only — no GPU required

Designed for learning & demonstration purposes

