📌 Save Karne Ka Tarika
Method 1: VS Code Se
Project root folder kholo VS Code mein

New file banao: README.md

Upar wala pura content paste karo

Save karo (Ctrl + S)

Method 2: Notepad Se
Notepad kholo

Pura content paste karo

File → Save As

Filename: README.md

Save as type: All Files (*.*) (zaroori hai!)

Encoding: UTF-8

Project root folder mein save karo

Method 3: Terminal Se (Fastest)
bash
# Project root mein jao
cd AI-Autonomous-Incident-Response-Agent

# Windows CMD
echo. > README.md

