code README.md
🎯 Ab GitHub Pe Push Karo
README banane ke baad:

bash
git add README.md
git commit -m "Add professional README"
git push
Refresh karo GitHub page ko — beautiful README dikhega! 🎉

💡 Extra Tips (Interview Ke Liye)
Screenshots folder banao — screenshots/ folder mein dashboard, incident detail, logs ki images daalo. README mein woh images reference ki hui hain.

LICENSE file add karo — GitHub pe repo kholo → Add file → Create new file → naam LICENSE → "MIT License" template choose karo.

Topics add karo — Repo page pe ⚙️ icon click karo → Topics mein ye daalo:

text
aiops, incident-response, llm, gemini-api, fastapi, react, 
sre, devops, observability, workflow-automation, python
Demo video banayo — 2-3 minute ka screen recording. README mein YouTube link daal do.

Live demo deploy karo (optional) — Render.com pe backend, Vercel pe frontend free mein deploy ho jayega.

