gigitnore file
📝 .gitignore File - Complete Content
Bhai ye production-grade .gitignore hai jo tumhare project (Python + React + SQLite + Gemini) ke liye perfect hai. Isse saari unwanted files GitHub pe jaane se rok jaayengi — jaise venv, node_modules, .env, *.db, etc.

